{"source_id": "baike_c6b95eef2e87", "title": "保护", "url": "http://baike.baidu.com/subview/369391/8050503.htm", "source_type": "baidu", "publisher": "百度百科", "published_at": null, "fetched_at": "2026-05-29T02:52:50.083830", "content": "保护，汉语词语，拼音bǎo hù，基本含义指通过爱护护卫使对象免受伤害或破坏。该词最早见于《尚书·毕命》。现代社会中，保护机制广泛应用于法律、环境、文化等领域，包括知识产权、生态环境公益诉讼、文物保护、未成年人权益保障及生物多样性保护等，成为维护社会公平、传承文明和促进可持续发展的重要方式。 基本信息：m25_nameC: 保护；m25_nameE: <a target=_blank href=\"/item/protect/72532\" data-lemmaid=\"72532\">protect</a>；m25_pinyin: bǎo hù<sup>1</sup><a name=\"ref_1\"></a>；m25_customDefault: 护卫使不受损害；保重，调护。；m25_homonym: <a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E4%BF%9D%E5%8D%AB/6546483\" data-lemmaid=\"6546483\">保卫</a>、<a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E6%8D%8D%E5%8D%AB/7999099\" data-lemmaid=\"7999099\">捍卫</a>；m25_source: 《书·毕命》；m25_antonym: <a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E6%AF%81%E5%9D%8F\">毁坏</a>、<a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E6%8D%9F%E5%9D%8F\">损坏</a>、<a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E7%A0%B4%E5%9D%8F/32871\" data-lemmaid=\"32871\">破坏</a>、<a target=_blank href=\"/item/%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3/5870889\" data-lemmaid=\"5870889\">伤害</a>；m25_customDefault: ㄅㄠˇ ㄏㄨˋ<sup>1</sup><a name=\"ref_1\"></a>", "trust_level": 4, "language": "zh-CN", "authors": [], "metadata": {"retriever": "BaiduCultureRetriever", "keyword": "保护", "match_score": 0, "content_chars": 898, "has_url": true, "source_rank_reason": "ranked by trust, recency and content length"}}
